## Preserved harness failure history

The failures below were harness construction/oracle errors, not product findings. Their correction is included to keep the replay history auditable.

- attempt-001-replay: ``cargo check --offline --manifest-path /private/tmp/foundation-content-search-probe/Cargo.toml --target-dir /private/tmp/arc01-slice02-cargo-target` exit `101`; attempted direct access to private `FrontmatterResult.value` and malformed diagnostic format arguments. Corrected to public `value()` accessor and valid format arguments.
- attempt-002: ``cargo check --offline --manifest-path /private/tmp/foundation-content-search-probe/Cargo.toml --target-dir /private/tmp/arc01-slice02-cargo-target` exit `101`; zero-limit task moved backend later needed by controls. Corrected by cloning backend/task state before spawn.
- attempts-006/007: probe process exit `101`; scratch assertion indexed an absent hyphen-token match. Corrected by choosing corpus/token boundary that actually discriminates.
- attempt-010: ``cargo check --offline --manifest-path /private/tmp/foundation-content-search-probe/Cargo.toml --target-dir /private/tmp/arc01-slice02-cargo-target` exit `101`; scratch lacked serde_json dependency for custom-filter fixture. Added only to scratch manifest.
- attempt-013: ``cargo run --offline --locked --manifest-path /private/tmp/foundation-content-search-probe/Cargo.toml --target-dir /private/tmp/arc01-slice02-cargo-target` exit `101`; feature reduction made scratch lock stale. Regenerated only scratch lock with `cargo generate-lockfile --offline`, then final exact locked run exited 0.

